          "short": "In each system, $y$ equals the common right-hand side and $x=-y$.",
          "worked": "The solutions are $(-1,1)$, $(-2,2)$, $(-3,3)$ and $(-2,2)$. Each has $x=-y$, with $y$ equal to the common right-hand side. Within this family, the solution depends only on that right-hand side.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
